>Does anyone out there know the syntax for using a wand of wishing?

You zap the wand and when it asks you what you want, you give it an item
exactly the way it would be listed in your inventory (if you had identified
it). For example, "a +3 elven cloak", "3 scrolls of genocide", "a ring of
teleport control", "3 potions of gain level", etc.  Note that "3" is the
magic number; if you go higher than that (in quantity or plusses) you lose.
Also, I don't think you can do something like "3 +3 crysknives"; you get one
number.

